          "description": "R25 #346: the backend AttemptReceipt sequence (strictly increasing per project, persisted in studio.json). success_rate.sql orders a flow's attempts by it (observation time only breaks ties). Integer >= 1; copied from the receipt, never generated by the frontend.",
